{"year":"2024","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"La 30.ª edición se realizó el 24 de febrero de 2024 en el Shrine Auditorium, en Los Ángeles, presentada por <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 17605, 'screen_type': person}\">Idris Elba</a> y transmitida en vivo por primera vez en <i>Netflix</i>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 872585, 'screen_type': movie}\">Oppenheimer</a> (2023) ganó los premios al elenco, a actor de reparto, con <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 3223, 'screen_type': person}\">Robert Downey Jr.</a>, y a actor, con <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 2037, 'screen_type': person}\">Cillian Murphy</a>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 10400, 'screen_type': person}\">Barbra Streisand</a> recibió el premio a la trayectoria. <i>No se incluyen los premios de televisión.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Película","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":872585,"name":"Oppenheimer","image_path":"/dUPQszWoRSE9FucJTbVp2bwEi9G.jpg","director":"Christopher Nolan","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/neeNHeXjMF5fXoCJRsOmkNGC7q.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":1056360,"name":"Ficción Estadounidense","image_path":"/bndwT7YCJv9nEHGSXuzvx9PJ013.jpg","director":"Cord Jefferson","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":346698,"name":"Barbie","image_path":"/pP12F7Gutn6CpHYaIPBlDRHlMlk.jpg","director":"Greta Gerwig","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":558915,"name":"El color púrpura","image_path":"/nZ3TV8mfwvQzgl5Ad8KH4P1kyq3.jpg","director":"Blitz Bazawule","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":466420,"name":"Los asesinos de la luna","image_path":"/kBLMPD5BCmcrHKIhjZ86uWHZG5K.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Actriz","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":1183917,"name":"Lily Gladstone","image_path":"/zYAN84WqZv2sbVE2JDkcWoXGoF7.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":466420,"name":"Assassinos da Lua das Flores","image_path":"/kBLMPD5BCmcrHKIhjZ86uWHZG5K.jpg","dir